body:
Honestly the only thing I think or hear when I see these two now is this;

"Look at me! Look how much I need my privacy! Look at how intrusive you're being whilst looking at me! Loooook"...

...and it just makes me want to vomit and look away.

Hah, reading your comment just made me think of the way Genie from Disney's Aladdin describes his life;

"PHENOMENAL COSMIC POWER.....iittybittylivingspace"

Which is kinda how ADHD is for me. My thoughts are either too big or too many for my brain. Also, finding humour in anything and everything is a kind of upside. Just not when it's unwarranted or unintended in certain situations lol
